type: dataset
title: "Circuits, Signals and Communications (Book 3 — The Circuits, Signals & Communications Core)"
abstract: >-
  An open textbook on the theory of electrical networks, continuous- and
  discrete-time signals, system behaviour, digital signal processing,
  information transmission, communication channels and introductory control:
  7 parts, 35 chapters and 201 computed figures, written in Markdown and LaTeX,
  with a typeset PDF and an MCP server.
authors:
